  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Round Shoelace, designed for 3D-printed footwear, features a snag-resistant weave. Two styles are available: the Normal version uses 100% abrasion-resistant polyester for daily wear, while the Reflective version incorporates light-reactive strips that create striking flashes under direct lighting, making it ideal for night runs or parties. Both versions thread smoothly through printed eyelets and lock securely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Dual-Color Style Options: Classic Black/White and Reflective Black/White variants to adapt to different styling scenarios."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Anti-Slip Durable Weave: Cross-woven high-density polyester fibers with heat-sealed reinforced tips ensure secure fastening without loosening."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Universal Fit Design: 100cm length compatible with various shoe eyelet systems, making lacing and adjustment effortless."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 40px; font-size: 24px;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The <strong>Round Shoelace</strong>, designed for 3D-printed footwear, features a snag-resistant weave. Two styles are available: the Normal version uses 100% abrasion-resistant polyester for daily wear, while the Reflective version incorporates light-reactive strips that create striking flashes under direct lighting, making it ideal for night runs or parties. Both versions thread smoothly through printed eyelets and lock securely.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/de0a3d859af04836b976958b28f9c8db/whale_4.JPEG\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 16.8028%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 19.7959%; height: 27px;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 25.0455%; height: 27px;\"><strong>Model Links</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 23.7801%; height: 27px;\"><strong>Need Other Accessories</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 16.8028%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Whaleberry</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 19.7959%; height: 25px;\"><strong>@CloudBerry</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 25.0455%; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/1229146-whaleberry#profileId-1247594\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Whaleberry</strong></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 23.7801%; height: 25px;\"><strong>No</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 表格对齐样式 -->\n<style>\n    .pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc {\n        padding: '0 20px'\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList {\n        width: 100%;\n        row-gap: 15px !important;\n        column-gap: 15px !important;\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_ic-p {\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_st-tbc .pct_tb .pct_td {\n        border-color: #ADADAD;\n    }\n\n    @media (min-width: 640px) {\n        .pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc {\n            padding: 0px !important\n        }\n\n        .pct_hardware-tableList {\n            width: 100%;\n            row-gap: 15px;\n            column-gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_st-tbc .pct_tb .pct_td {\n            height: 50px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc pct_padding-in-mobile .pct_hardware-tableList pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; font-size: 24px;\">Basic Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\"><!-- 左列 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 45%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<tbody><!-- 模块开头-->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Length</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">1m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Quantity</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<p>Normal: Black &amp; White</p>\n<p>Reflective: Black &amp; White</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右列 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 45%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<tbody><!-- 模块开头-->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Weight</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">2 Pairs per set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<p>Normal: 100% polyester thread</p>\n<p>Reflective: 72% polyester thread + 28% reflective thread</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px;\">Product Feature</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dual-Color Style Options: </strong>Classic Black/White and Reflective Black/White variants to adapt to different styling scenarios.</li>\n<li class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Anti-Slip Durable Weave:</strong> Cross-woven high-density polyester fibers with heat-sealed reinforced tips ensure secure fastening without loosening.</li>\n<li class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Universal Fit Design: </strong>100cm length compatible with various shoe eyelet systems, making lacing and adjustment effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The Round Shoelace, designed for 3D-printed footwear, features a snag-resistant weave. Two styles are available: the Normal version uses 100% abrasion-resistant polyester for daily wear, while the Reflective version incorporates light-reactive strips that create striking flashes under direct lighting, making it ideal for night runs or parties. Both versions thread smoothly through printed eyelets and lock securely.\n\nDual-Color Style Options: Classic Black/White and Reflective Black/White variants to adapt to different styling scenarios.\n\nAnti-Slip Durable Weave: Cross-woven high-density polyester fibers with heat-sealed reinforced tips ensure secure fastening without loosening.\n\nUniversal Fit Design: 100cm length compatible with various shoe eyelet systems, making lacing and adjustment effortless.",
